# Pairs with IntentsResolve. Without the Indeterminate verdict at the maximum
# pending age, an intent whose anchor history is incomplete waits forever.
#
# DEADLOCK: off is required: once the remaining intent can never resolve,
# no action is enabled, and with the deadlock check on TLC reports the
# deadlock before it evaluates the property.
MODULE: AuditReconcilerWaitsForever
TARGET: IntentsResolve
CLASS: Temporal
DEADLOCK: off
SUMMARY: an intent whose outcome cannot be proven is never resolved
PERTURBS: Reconcile

--- FIND
                     [] OTHER -> IF expired THEN "Indeterminate" ELSE "wait"
--- REPLACE
                     [] OTHER -> "wait"
--- END
